WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
SCH100 bag opening and feeding.
The linear track is customer-specific.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The tooling engages a bag
and lifts it from the stack.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The robot and custom track transfer
the bag to the feeding station.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Bag opening and material discharge
into the receiving unit below.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.670
The packaging bag moves
to an adjacent receiving position.
